# Manual public-provider examples. These are external read-only calls.
# Never run as part of normal tests/builds. No credentials or local registry.
# Source mapping, axes, constraints and product contract:
# ../docs/architecture/public-api-integration.md
# Encoded FILTER values intentionally preserve verified unqualified property names.

### Locality candidates (UUG)
GET https://services.gugik.gov.pl/uug/?request=GetAddress&address=Marki

### Street within a locality (UUG)
GET https://services.gugik.gov.pl/uug/?request=GetAddress&address=Marki%2C+Andersa

### Same text can mean a locality; do not relabel as street
GET https://services.gugik.gov.pl/uug/?request=GetAddress&address=Lipowa

